title: Authorizations › New case › The stepper and the four steps
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId
intro: The strip at the top of New case: Referral, Medical records, Agents work, Review and sign. Earlier steps can be clicked to go back; later ones open only through the step's own button.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A case is open on any step"
screen sc1 "Stepper under the title\n1 Referral · 2 Medical records · 3 Agents work · 4 Review and sign"
process p1 "Current step: dark circle with its number\nEarlier steps: green circle with a tick\nLater steps: grey circle"
decision d1 "Which step did the person click?"
process pNo "Current step and later steps are disabled\nNothing happens"
click c1 "Click an earlier step\n'Referral', 'Medical records' or 'Agents work'"
process p2 "Case moves to that step\nWhat was entered and what the agents did is kept"
screen sc2 "Page shows that step\nTitle and sentence change with it"

group gSub "The sentence under the title"
  screen t1 "Referral: 'Start with the referral. Drop the documents and Reader lists anything that is missing.'"
  screen t2 "Medical records: 'Drop what you have. Reader sorts the files and lists what is still missing, then the agents check the payer's rules.'\nTop right: 'Use sample chart'"
  screen t3 "Agents work: 'The agents are reading the chart and checking Summit's rules. Questions come to you only when they must.'"
  screen t4 "Review and sign: 'Nothing goes to the payer until a clinician signs.'\nTitle 'Ready for your signature'"
endgroup

group gFwd "Moving forward and back: each step's own buttons"
  click b1 "Referral: 'Accept referral and continue', 'Continue to medical records' or 'No referral? Continue without one'"
  click b2 "Medical records: 'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Continue'"
  click b3 "Agents work: 'Back', 'Pause all agents', 'Skip ahead', 'Review and sign'"
  click b4 "Review and sign: 'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Sign and send'"
endgroup
process pBack "'Back' goes one step back\nMedical records to Referral; Agents work to Medical records; Review and sign to Agents work"
process pNext "Forward buttons stay disabled until the step is ready\n'Accept referral and continue' waits for the required referral items;\n'Continue' waits for nothing missing; 'Review and sign' waits for the agents"

click cLink "Click the link 'Case Manager' above the title"
goto gCm "Continues in: Case Manager"

screen sFull "Stepper on the full referral page\n'Referral' is current and no step is clickable\nThe button 'Back to the case' sits beside the crumbs"
goto gFull "Continues in: New case › Referral › The full referral page"

goto g1 "Continues in: New case › Referral › Start screen"
goto g2 "Continues in: New case › Medical records › The checklist and Continue"
goto g3 "Continues in: New case › Agents work › Start the run and watch it"
goto g4 "Continues in: New case › Review and sign › The draft and the summary"

s1 --> sc1 --> p1 --> d1
d1 -->|Current or later step| pNo
d1 -->|Earlier step| c1 --> p2 --> sc2
sc2 --> t1
sc2 --> t2
sc2 --> t3
sc2 --> t4
t1 --> b1 --> g1
t2 --> b2 --> g2
t3 --> b3 --> g3
t4 --> b4 --> g4
b2 --> pBack
b3 --> pBack
b4 --> pBack
b1 -.-> pNext
b2 -.-> pNext
b3 -.-> pNext
sc1 --> cLink --> gCm
sc1 -.-> sFull --> gFull
